    vanta.lol v6.1 - merged UI and features
    Executor-friendly interface, player overlay, aim assist and configuration panel.

    Included:
      * RightShift menu toggle with cursor unlock/restore
      * Draggable window and four working tabs
      * Toggles, sliders, dropdowns and color themes
      * Watermark / FPS / clock overlay
      * Save / load / reset user configuration (when file APIs are available)

    Feature defaults are OFF; configure them in the menu.
    Hitbox option draws a local visual hitbox overlay and does not alter server physics.
]]

